  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "えいようまんてんの　ツルに　はなを\nくっつける。　はなは　かっせいかし\nかぐわしい　アロマが　ただよいだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "영양 만점의 줄기에 꽃을\n붙인다. 꽃이 활성화해서\n향기로운 아로마가 풍긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "將花黏在充滿營養的藤蔓上。\n花會活化，飄散出迷人的芳香。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa liane gluante diffuse des nutriments dans les\nfleurs qu’elle happe. Ces dernières dégagent\nalors un léger parfum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon sieht aus, als hätte man Blüten\nan einer nahrhaften Ranke angebracht. Diese\nblühen auf und sind äußerst wohlriechend.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prende flores en su tallo, que es muy rico en\nnutrientes. Las flores se revitalizan y\ndesprenden una agradable fragancia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Alla sua liana ricca di nutrienti attacca dei fiori\nche così riprendono vigore, emanando piacevoli\nfragranze.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It attaches flowers to its highly nutritious vine.\nThis revitalizes the flowers, and they give off\nan aromatic scent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栄養満点の　ツルに　花を\nくっつける。　花は　活性化し\n香しい　アロマが　漂いだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "将花粘在充满营养的藤蔓上。\n花会活化，芳香也会飘散出来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prende flores en su tallo, que es muy rico en\nnutrientes. Las flores se revitalizan y\ndesprenden una agradable fragancia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツルに　ついた　はなを　うかべた\nおふろは　リラックスこうかが　あり\nおおくの　じょせいに　だいにんき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "덩굴에 붙어 있는 꽃을 띄운 목욕은\n긴장을 풀어주는 효과가 있어\n많은 여성들에게 인기가 높다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把藤蔓上附著的花放進浴盆裡飄浮，\n泡澡時就會有舒緩的效果，\n在廣大女性中極具人氣。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Utilisées en bain, les fleurs qui se collent sur sa\nliane possèdent des vertus relaxantes. Elles\nont déjà séduit les gens du monde entier.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein Wellness-Bad mit seinen Blüten hilft, dem\nAlltag zu entfliehen und gut zu entspannen.\nBei vielen Menschen daher äußerst beliebt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un baño aderezado con las flores ensartadas en\nsu sarmiento tiene un efecto muy relajante, por\nlo que este Pokémon se ha vuelto muy popular.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se si immergono i suoi fiori in un bagno caldo\nsi produce un effetto rilassante. Ciò lo ha reso\nmolto popolare nei centri termali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Baths prepared with the flowers from its vine\nhave a relaxing effect, so this Pokémon\nis a hit with many people.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ツルに　ついた　花を　浮かべた\nお風呂は　リラックス効果が　あり\n多くの　女性に　大人気。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "把藤蔓上附着的花漂浮在浴盆里，\n泡澡时会有舒缓的效果，\n在广大女性中极具人气。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un baño aderezado con las flores ensartadas en\nsu sarmiento tiene un efecto muy relajante, por\nlo que este Pokémon se ha vuelto muy popular.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あたまから　ねばりけの　ある　ツルを\nのばして　はなを　つんで　じぶんを\nかざる。　はなが　ないと　ふあん。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "머리에서 끈적거리는 시위를\n늘려서 꽃을 따서 치장한다.\n꽃이 없으면 불안하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會從頭上伸出有黏性的藤蔓\n摘下花朵，拿來裝飾自己。\n沒有花就會感到不安。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ramasse des fleurs en déployant la liane\ngluante accrochée à sa tête et s’en agrémente.\nIl se sent mal à l’aise lorsqu’il n’en a pas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit der klebrigen Ranke an seinem Kopf pflückt\nes Blumen und schmückt sich dann mit ihnen.\nFehlt ihm sein Blütenschmuck, wird es nervös.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Adorna con flores el tallo pegajoso que brota\nde su cabeza. Sin ellas se siente intranquilo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ama adornare di fiori la liana appiccicosa\nche gli spunta dalla testa. Se resta senza\nfiori, si fa prendere dall’ansia.",
